# CVEs with fix versions identified by Trivy but not yet available in the
# AL2023 package repositories. Remove entries once the fixed packages land.
#
# 2026-11-15: no suppressions needed. The Dockerfile now runs
# `dnf upgrade --releasever=latest`, which reaches every fixed AL2023 RPM
# regardless of the release the base image was cut from. An unfiltered
# Trivy scan (no ignore file, all severities, including unfixed) reports
# zero findings. All 19 previous entries (curl-minimal/libcurl-minimal,
# cyrus-sasl-lib, libcap, pcre2/pcre2-syntax, python3/python3-libs,
# python3.12/python3.12-libs, ca-certificates) are fixed in the installed
# RPMs and were removed.
#
# Add new entries only after confirming with
# `dnf --releasever=latest list --showduplicates <pkg>` that no fixed build
# exists. Give each entry a dated justification comment.
